@startuml
title D04 · 行动决策与执行状态分离（第二轮领域候选版）
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFBF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK SC
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EDF3ED
skinparam stateBorderColor #486958
state "行动决策" as Decision {
 state "已被替代" as Superseded
 state "已跳过" as Skipped
 state "已采纳" as Adopted
 state "待决定提案" as Proposed
 [*] --> Proposed
 Proposed --> Adopted : 确认采纳\n行为、约束及行动窗口
 Proposed --> Skipped : 用户跳过
 Proposed --> Superseded : 修改或更换\n重新校验新提案
}
state "执行状态" as Execution {
 state "待反馈" as PendingFeedback
 state "执行未知" as Unknown
 state "已有有效执行自述" as Reported
 state "已删除退出处理" as Excluded
 PendingFeedback --> Unknown : 窗口已结束且无有效执行自述
 PendingFeedback --> Reported : 用户确认执行自述
 Unknown --> Reported : 用户迟到确认执行自述
 Reported --> Reported : 修正同一行动\n追加自述版本
 Reported --> Unknown : 撤回有效执行自述\n[窗口已结束]
Reported --> PendingFeedback : 撤回有效执行自述\n[窗口尚未结束]
 PendingFeedback --> Excluded : 用户确认删除
 Unknown --> Excluded : 用户确认删除
 Reported --> Excluded : 用户确认删除
}
Adopted --> PendingFeedback : 仅已采纳时成立
Decision -[hidden]down-> Execution
legend bottom
跳过没有执行状态。
有效执行自述：完成、部分完成或未完成，取最新有效版本。
迟到反馈不自动延长窗口。
已删除事实不得恢复后继续处理。
endlegend
@enduml
